### ✅ **Jira User Story**

**Title:**
Wayfinder — Webinar Recommendations (Job 2)

---

**As a**
Wayfinder user,

**I want**
the agent to suggest relevant webinars based on my topic or activity,

**So that**
I can easily learn more and improve my skills.

---

**Acceptance Criteria:**

* The agent recommends webinars when a user asks directly (e.g., "Show me webinars on denials").
* The agent **auto-suggests webinars after answering a Knowledge Article (KA) question**.
* Each recommendation shows title, short description, date/time (or on-demand), and a link.
* Suggests up to 3 webinars with a "View All" option.

